    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Synopsis</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mad scientist has kidnapped you and turned you into one of his test subjects, number 69. Since you\u2019ve been classified as extremely dangerous, you find yourself waking up, locked away in a high security room, inside of a containment cell. Now you must break out and become the host for a parasitic slime ball named \u201cPairiasite\u201d. In order to get to the mad scientist you will have to fight all the other test subjects that he has created, thus turning them into brainless killing machines with super powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you and Pairiasite will need to break into and platform through each habitat to get to the test subjects that are kept in them. There are a variety of habitats that you will need to platform through, ranging from a fancy ice cube, to the desert, and even to the future. Each test subject has their own unique powers that you will need to fight against. Such as super strength, super speed, and a lot more really super stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains bright flashing lights and loud noises, that may be unsuitable for people with epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Synopsis</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mad scientist has kidnapped you and turned you into one of his test subjects, number 69. Since you\u2019ve been classified as extremely dangerous, you find yourself waking up, locked away in a high security room, inside of a containment cell. Now you must break out and become the host for a parasitic slime ball named \u201cPairiasite\u201d. In order to get to the mad scientist you will have to fight all the other test subjects that he has created, thus turning them into brainless killing machines with super powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you and Pairiasite will need to break into and platform through each habitat to get to the test subjects that are kept in them. There are a variety of habitats that you will need to platform through, ranging from a fancy ice cube, to the desert, and even to the future. Each test subject has their own unique powers that you will need to fight against. Such as super strength, super speed, and a lot more really super stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains bright flashing lights and loud noises, that may be unsuitable for people with epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
